                "_key": "about-accred-1-span",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Through affiliations with respected organizations and platforms such as Cognia, College Board, NCDA, Pearson Education, Apple Teacher, STEM.org, Microsoft Certified Educator, ABRSM, and other leading educational providers, we ensure that our students benefit from high-quality learning opportunities, globally aligned standards, advanced academic pathways, and a future-focused educational experience."
